      "content": "exactly. it's just a cycle of losing everything that matters. you work, you care, and then it's just gone. and you're left with this hollow shell of a life. i look at my life and i don't see a future, i just see more of this same silence and more of this same loss. i'm just so tired of the struggle to keep going when it feels like nothing stays. does it ever actually get better, or is it just more of the same?",
